A server cannot infer an address family from a port, so IPv6 listening is the explicit `listen6`. The CLIENT side needs no new spelling: `connect` infers the family from the numeric address, so `connect("::1", port)` just works. `bound_port` covers both families. An EFFECT, so no spec (R0007).

